## STATE AS OF HANDOFF (2026-08-20) — §32b VOIDS `incline_set_v1`

* **§32b — the incline set finished rendering and cannot be probed.** With the
  start pinned and the cube released from rest, position in ANY single frame is the
  acceleration, so mu reads off one frame's cube mask at **R2 0.877 (centroid) /
  0.988 (+ mask area)** against the 0.459 the set exists to impose. The frame-0
  check passed because frame 0 was the one frame that was clean.
* **The fix for §32a caused it.** Pinning `s0` moved the leak from frame 0 to every
  later frame. Third distinct route into the identity trap, and the third one to
  arrive through the rendering or the sampler rather than the physics.
* **Generator and validator are fixed and audited, nothing is re-rendered.**
  Start jitter + launch speed take the single-frame route to 0.077 while leaving the
  3-frame route at 0.997 and `corr(mu, a)` at −0.65. Zero rejections over 80k draws.
  Next GPU job: `incline_set_v2`, ~5 hours.

